    "## Getting started\n",
    "\n",
    "Run the next cell. In Google Colab, upload this notebook and choose **Runtime → Run all** after completing your tasks. The first run may install Python packages using the internet. After installation, all circuit simulations run locally on the CPU.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Bit order convention:** Qiskit writes the most significant bit on the **left** of a bitstring. For example `\"10\"` means qubit 1 is `1` and qubit 0 is `0`. Our checks follow this convention.\n",
    "\n",
    "**If you get `ModuleNotFoundError`:** rerun the installation cell or restart the notebook kernel and rerun."
   ]
  },
