    "### Task 0C — Detecting phase (15 min)\n",
    "\n",
    "Apply H, Z, H in that order. **Expected:** the final measurement gives `1` with certainty."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "3de3c3b0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
